title:StartNode
---
<<HideMarkerJude Jude>>

Jude: Hey! Y'all finally made it! I was startin' to get worried there.
Jude: As I've promised, I got some elixirs and other stuff that'll keep y'all alive.
Loveday: What can I offer in exchange?
Jude: Maybe snaggin' a few coins from those damn guards can work! I saw them down to the right!
Jude: Shop has nothing too crazy right now, but feel free to come back to see if I cooked up something new!
-> Sure thing.
    <<open_shop Player>>
    <<ShowMarkerForest Jude>>
-> I think we're good for now.
    <<ShowMarkerForest Jude>>
===

title:NPCFight1Win
---
<<HideMarkerJude Jude>>
<<ShowFight2 Jude>>
Jude: Hey. I heard y'all crushed it out there! 
Jude: That's good. They've really to started to piss me off pestering about "food permits."
Jude: Anyways, look at... THIS! 
Loveday: What is it?
Jude: It's garlic! Pretty potent for vampires~
<<unlock_garlic Player>>    
-> Why not.
    <<open_shop Player>>
-> I'm okay.
===

title:NPCFight1Lose
---
Jude: Hey. Y'all are Looking rough...
Jude: Here to buy somethin'?
-> Yes, we need to. 
    <<open_shop Player>>
-> Not right now. 
