title:NPCFight2Win
---
<<HideMarkerJude Jude>>
<<ShowFight3 Jude>>
Jude: Oh hey! I was startin' to get worried again. 
Jude: But... good news.
Loveday: What is it?
Jude: Check it out. 
Jude: A special mix of loam that can help a fallen teammate get back on their feet.
Loveday: Sounds... useful.
Jude: I heard y'all were gettin' ready to battle that Unicorn?
Jude: Then trust me. Y'all will need this. 
<<unlock_loam Player>>   
<<unlock_garlic Player>>  
-> We need this. 
    <<open_shop Player>>
-> I'm okay.
